    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "9C6184E6696213A4",
      "text": "我知道了",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "9C6187E6696218BD",
      "text": "蹑手蹑脚……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_03",
      "hash64": "E3AE77C10464675F",
      "text": "偷偷摸摸……（感谢。）[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_01",
      "hash64": "56D19D9ADF00CBC7",
      "text": "唔唔唔唔唔……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_02",
      "hash64": "56D19E9ADF00CD7A",
      "text": "我们学校的小卖部，\\n商品真是齐全……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_03",
      "hash64": "56D19F9ADF00CF2D",
      "text": "说实话，\\n在下过去太小看这里了。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_04",
      "hash64": "E3AE74C104646246",
      "text": "……他好像很感动。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_05",
      "hash64": "E3AE75C1046463F9",
      "text": "看起来不会被发现，\\n我们正常地说话吧。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_06",
      "hash64": "E3AE72C104645EE0",
      "text": "某种意义上，天星队的成员里\\n最让我担心的就是秋明……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_04",
      "hash64": "56D1989ADF00C348",
      "text": "……那个，这位店员。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_05",
      "hash64": "56D1999ADF00C4FB",
      "text": "吾想购买今日发售\\n并且限定５套的\\r\\n忍者角色扮演套装……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_01",
      "hash64": "CEB99516CE53ECD8",
      "text": "我看一下，\\n忍者角色扮演套装……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_02",
      "hash64": "CEB99816CE53F1F1",
      "text": "……抱歉，\\n刚才有客人买走了最后２套，\\r\\n所以已经售罄了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_06",
      "hash64": "56D19A9ADF00C6AE",
      "text": "什么……！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_07",
      "hash64": "56D19B9ADF00C861",
      "text": "如果买不到那个套装，\\n吾就……吾就……！！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_08",
      "hash64": "56D1949ADF00BC7C",
      "text": "好吧，吾去找\\n刚才你提到的那个客人！！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_09",
      "hash64": "56D1959ADF00BE2F",
      "text": "吾会用这坚定的眼神，\\n不惜下跪来求得套装！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_07",
      "hash64": "E3AE73C104646093",
      "text": "哇！哇！\\n真是意外，秋明长得很清爽嘛！！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_08",
      "hash64": "E3AE80C1046476AA",
      "text": "不不，比起这个，\\n下跪什么的会引起不太好的注目……\\r\\n还是阻止他比较好，对吧？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "9C6186E66962170A",
      "text": "阻止他吧",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "9C6181E669620E8B",
      "text": "看看情况吧",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09a",
      "hash64": "45FEB6FA76B84DF4",
      "text": "正、正该如此……！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09b",
      "hash64": "45FEB9FA76B8530D",
      "text": "啊，可是……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_01",
      "hash64": "CFF667CFE19942AD",
      "text": "啊，秋明～\\n你怎么在这里！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_10",
      "hash64": "56D5229ADF03E39D",
      "text": "同胞啊！！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_11",
      "hash64": "56D5219ADF03E1EA",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，同胞啊……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_12",
      "hash64": "56D5209ADF03E037",
      "text": "吾……和同胞你约好的\\n忍者角色扮演服装……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_02",
      "hash64": "CFF664CFE1993D94",
      "text": "啊，那个，\\n我买了２套哦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_13",
      "hash64": "56D51F9ADF03DE84",
      "text": "……啊？[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_03",
      "hash64": "CFF665CFE1993F47",
      "text": "刚才来小卖部看了看，\\n服装正好到货了，\\r\\n我就把我们两个的份都买好了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_04",
      "hash64": "CFF662CFE1993A2E",
      "text": "那套服装超受欢迎，\\n还好买到了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_05",
      "hash64": "CFF663CFE1993BE1",
      "text": "我们赶快去外面\\n扮忍者玩吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_14",
      "hash64": "56D51E9ADF03DCD1",
      "text": "……竟然是这样！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_15",
      "hash64": "56D51D9ADF03DB1E",
      "text": "那么就让吾回房间\\n把自己的手里剑拿来，\\r\\n然后一起扔着玩吧。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_06",
      "hash64": "CFF660CFE19936C8",
      "text": "哇！太棒了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_16",
      "hash64": "56D51C9ADF03D96B",
      "text": "用吾的缝纫技术，\\n还能把服装改造成\\r\\n毒感满满的样子哦！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_07",
      "hash64": "CFF661CFE199387B",
      "text": "嗯……\\n那倒是不太需要。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_17",
      "hash64": "56D51B9ADF03D7B8",
      "text": "哈哈哈……你这家伙……[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
